WEBVTT

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.980
I have a report for you guys.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.090
I've aggregated some of my data on SoLaMi SMILE.

00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:12.160
This is the growth rate of our fan community.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.960
This is our amount of likes per concert.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.550
And this is our time in the news.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.240
They're all growing consistently.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.250
Is that good?

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.730
Of course! But don't let your guard down.

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:28.800
We've just found a powerful rival in Dressing Pafé.

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:33.720
We'll have to buckle up and work harder than ever to win the Paradise Coord.

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:35.180
Capisce!

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:36.640
Yeah.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.640
Much obliged!

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.870
You're Manaka Lala, aren't you?

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:44.850
C-Capisce...

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:49.420
I'd be much obliged if you could just confirm on record that you're going to PriPara

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.820
despite it being against the headmistress's policy.

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:52.990
Eh?

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:30.960
Exclusive Scoop!
Lala's Secret Revealed!?

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:32.880
Uh, err...

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:33.960
And who are you?

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:35.050
Oh, pardon me.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:37.730
Where there's a scoop, I'm not far behind.

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:41.260
Tokuda Nene of the Paprika Academy Newspaper club.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.620
Nene?

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:43.630
Come on, come on!

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:45.970
I'd be much obliged if you answered swiftly and honestly.

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.540
Lunch of... Oh!

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:50.970
I think spaghetti and meat sauce is the ultimate lunch.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:52.760
No! Who said anything about lunch?

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.380
Well pizza and yogurt are the best breakfast.

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:55.730
No!

00:02:55.730 --> 00:03:00.650
I just wanted to know if you're going to PriPara despite being in an elementary grade.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:01.780
So, are you?

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.870
W-Well, that is...

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:10.450
Paprika academy rule #6278:

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:13.040
You are to treat your underclassmen gently.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:21.620
And article 173: You should at least know the phrase "much obliged" by your third schoolyear!

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:22.770
Eh?

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:26.280
That makes 198 warning tickets!

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:27.380
Now, let's go!

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:28.310
Capisce!

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:32.340
Tokuda never lets her prey escape!

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.270
That was a shock.

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:38.080
This could be bad.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:42.700
According to my calculations, Tokuda Nene is in league with Headmistress Ookanda.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:43.490
Eh?

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:48.700
And should she find out, Lala, you won't be able to keep going to PriPara.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:50.410
N-No way!

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:56.600
Have you managed to prove Manaka Lala's been going to PriPara?

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.090
I'm afraid I'm still working on it.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:01.550
But she is clearly hiding something.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:04.050
I will no doubt have definite proof soon.

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:05.760
I'm counting on you.

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:10.730
Yes ma'am! I hate PriPara with all my being.

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:12.440
Of course you do!

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:15.670
PriPara must never be forgiven!

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:22.860
Manaka, today is the day I will prove your involvement with PriPara!

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:27.780
Gah! Mireille's gonna yell at me for being late again!

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:29.950
Eh?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.410
I'd be much obliged if you'd just stop fleeing!

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:34.470
Wait!

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:35.500
Stay away!

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:38.380
Wait! Wait... Wai...

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:42.840
Damn elementary schoolers!

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:44.840
Mireille! Sophie!

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.990
What's with the panting?

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:50.980
Nene's after me again.

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:53.110
Let's hurry to PriPara then!

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:53.820
Yeah!

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.980
PriPara Change Complete.

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:02.490
Complete. Pri!

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.450
Complete...

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:07.950
That was close.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:09.620
We can't let out guard down-pri.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:12.160
We'll have to be careful even in here.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:13.520
Capisce!

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:15.370
No "capisce" allowed!

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:19.890
Even if you look different, your catchphrase will give you away-pri.

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:20.590
Oh yeah!

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:26.590
Got it? If you want to keep being an idol you definitely, <i>definitely</i> can't say it-pri!

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.280
Yeah, cap—

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:29.550
Stop!

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:32.560
Calamari...

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.300
Calamari!

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.530
The pose is off limits too-pri!

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:39.600
Ca... Ca... Calamari!

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:48.130
Not here... Little miss Capisce must have slipped in to PriPara.

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:48.950
No other way...

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:54.780
Don't think I didn't get a PriTicket too!

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:57.370
I've just been using it as a flyswatter though.

00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:59.330
Much obliged.

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:01.330
First time, is it?

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:03.550
I'll register a default outfit for you.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:06.380
Let's see, I think you'd do well with—

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:07.560
No thank you!

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:09.260
My interest is purely journalistic!

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:13.270
Well, you're the first one I've gotten that from...

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:14.720
But if that's the case...

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:19.730
We'll prepare you a press outfit.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:23.370
Much obliged!

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:25.180
Welcome to PriPara Town.

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:27.220
Infiltration time!

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:30.870
So this is PriPara...

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:34.920
Full of those tacky idols, just as I imagined.

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:36.240
This sucks!

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:43.210
There's a group of idiot idols fussing about.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.170
You're always so cute, Lala!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:50.640
Thanks! And that dress is super cute too, Hina!

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:53.160
Don't put effort into the show today, Sophie.

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:54.560
Of course, Yui.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.680
Do your thing, Mireille!

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:00.520
Okay, Aoi! Pop Step Gotcha!

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.480
You too, Lala!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.440
Okay! Ca—

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:10.160
You may look a bit different, but there's no mistaking your identity!

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:11.820
Might as well admit it!

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:12.620
What's the matter?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:15.330
Ca... Ca... Ca...

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:16.830
Callus!

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:22.330
Th-That's your catchphrase?

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:25.000
Ca... Callus!

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:29.720
Hey people! Aren't you getting tired of dingy old SoLaMi SMILE?

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:33.930
Whoa! It's the new rising stars, Dressing Pafé!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:37.820
We're looking for fanclub members!

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:41.260
Sign up and you'll get a Friend Ticket with a kiss mark from Leona on it!

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:43.540
Dorothy, that's embarrassing...

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:45.610
Thank you for your support.

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:50.570
Ahh, our fans!

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:53.780
Sorry, Team Callus.

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:56.620
I just want to hear that "capisce".

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:58.880
Who's that?

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:06.040
Let's start our joint interview for PriPara TV, PriPara Radio, and PriPara Magazine.

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:08.100
Okay, we're ready!

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:08.630
Pri!

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:11.260
What kind of place is PriPara to you, Lala?

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:14.530
Okay! PriPara is where I come to hang out with...

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:16.000
Look over here if you would!

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:16.970
Cap—uh...

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:19.180
Smile for the camera, please!

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:22.580
Cap... Ca... Cu...

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.150
Cutlets!

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:26.610
This look good to you?

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:29.220
Ca... Catfish!

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:32.170
This is going in next week's Paprika Newspaper!

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.070
C-Crab sticks!

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:37.720
So is it cutlets? Or calamari?

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:40.080
Catfish? Or maybe crab sticks?

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.000
Cuh, Crab sticks!

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.960
Okay, okay!

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:47.460
Why dont'cha interview us?

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:51.710
To be in PriPara is to trust yourself and to strive to better yourself.

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.920
And through that, to help others better themselves.

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:57.850
Looks like we could have a fun interview with you, Dressing Pafé.

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:00.560
Crab sticks!

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:03.020
See you, team crab stick!

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:05.640
Come on and spit that "capisce" out already!

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:09.570
You what?

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:13.070
Lala's being hounded by a paparazzi-kumamimumemo?

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.780
I can't even concentrate on my homework.

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:19.490
Unforgivable-kuma. Leave it to me-kuma.

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:25.830
You the one who's been snooping around my idol's private life?

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:28.710
I won't let you dig anything up on Lala!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:32.800
You'll get your scoop over my dead body-kuma!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.260
Year's supply of green drink.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:37.790
Kuma? You've got good eye-kuma!

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:42.190
You prepared that just to get me on your side?

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:45.100
I have a whole bunch of stuff you could threaten her with-kuma.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.590
See here.

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:47.480
Much obliged.

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:54.350
Amazing shots of her dozing off in the dressing room-kuma!

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:56.950
I have a bunch of the others, too!

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:02.830
What do you think you're doing-pri!

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:05.910
Go hibernate forever!

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:09.040
I'm sorry! I got caught in the moment!

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:14.160
Sorry about all the trouble...

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:16.010
It's not your fault-pri.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.220
Don't apologize about it again-pri.

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:20.930
Lala, chin up.

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:23.280
Sophie...

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:26.550
We've got your back, Lala-pri.

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:30.150
Mireille... Okay! Let's go practice!

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:33.860
Not before you finish your homework-pri.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.280
That capricious capisce girl...

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.340
An idol must also excel in studies-pri!

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.240
Yeah! Let's do this!

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:46.240
Why won't you just reveal yourself?

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:55.430
One, two, three, four, one, two, three, four...

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:56.090
C'mon!

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:58.050
Pshu...

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:04.520
Let's try that part again.

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:05.390
Okay.

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:10.290
If I don't get something good soon...

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:12.100
What've you been skulking around for?

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:15.110
Shion!

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:20.510
I'd be much obliged if you could confirm that SoLaMi SMILE's Lala is from Paprika Elementary.

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:21.320
She is, right? Right?

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:27.290
Please do tell! We can't allow elementary students to get away with coming to places like this!

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.750
I won't have you interfere with our bout.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:33.960
SoLaMi SMILE will fall by <i>my</i> hand.

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:40.150
But I have no time for this. I mustn't forego training.

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:45.900
Model walking in a perfect line demands balance from your whole body.

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:49.210
A go board on one's head is a convenient tool for building a good posture.

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:50.880
Don't go off on your own, Shion!

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.560
I want to try it too.

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:55.590
Don't sneak off to practice all on your own. I'm better than you anyway!

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:57.550
I... I won't lose!

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:01.430
What's this about a bout? They're just idols.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:07.200
All they did today was prance around in fancy dresses and get fawned over by rabid fans and interviewers!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:11.410
Oh yeah! Their dressing room must be empty now...

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:14.180
That was some good training.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:17.380
Our show today is gonna go off without a hitch-pri!

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.620
Nene?

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:24.300
Here's my definite proof!

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:28.720
Paprika Academy class 5-2, Manaka Lala!

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:47.630
Just as I thought!

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:49.480
I have my proof.

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:51.200
Manaka Lala, you're under arrest!

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:55.400
I photographed everything, so there's no getting out!

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.330
I'll report everything to headmistress Ookanda!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.120
The headmistress!?

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:00.710
I knew your were working for her-pri!

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.300
Please, anything but that!

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:05.590
Gotcha! Your evidence is as good as erased!

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:11.600
That won't change a thing, I already sent them to my home computer.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:15.570
Please!

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:17.690
Please don't tell the headmistress!

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:20.730
How about another big scoop instead of this-pri?

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:21.400
What?

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:25.650
I have tons of photos of Kuma looking like an idiot!

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:29.160
I got a bunch just in case I needed some leverage-pri.

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:30.070
No deal.

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:33.610
I'll be going then.

00:13:33.610 --> 00:13:36.370
Finally, I can get far away from PriPara.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:41.210
Wait! Why do you hate PriPara so much?

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:45.130
My calculations point to some deep-seated reason-pri.

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.840
I-It's nothing like that!

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:49.550
So many photos...

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:51.510
Wh-What are you doing?

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:53.970
Give it back! Give it back!

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:55.180
Geez!

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.290
I thought I deleted that.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:13:59.830
Who's that-pri?

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:00.900
Damn it...

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:04.300
Well, this is a good chance to educate you.

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:06.200
I hope it'll open your eyes too!

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:08.910
That's Koga from the newspaper club!

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:11.290
<i>As for the cover story of the next issue...</i>

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:15.590
He wanted to be a journalist and was so smart and reliable.

00:14:15.590 --> 00:14:19.220
He was my... first love.

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:22.470
But a great tragedy was to befall him...

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:24.000
Of all the things, he...

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.180
<i>Supreme cuteness! PriPara idols!</i>

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:32.430
Pri woohoo! Para woohoo! <i>Moe</i> woohoo!

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:35.320
<i>Disappointment!</i>

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:38.100
He got obsessed with PriPara idols!

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:42.820
Turning my hardworking upperclassman into an idiot...

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:44.820
You PriPara idols are evil!

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:47.520
If only there were no idols...

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:51.960
That's a heck of a reason to wind up hating PriPara...

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:53.680
You get it now, don't you?

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:57.700
I detest you idols and your frivolity.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:59.150
I hate you!

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:00.460
Nene...

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:03.960
If you want to reveal that secret, go ahead!

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:08.500
Nene, PriPara is a very important place to me.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.180
It's the place where I get to shine together with everyone!

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:15.100
Please! Let me stay here!

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:22.770
Well, I don't get it. What's supposed to be good about PriPara?

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:26.730
If you don't understand, should you not try to seek understanding?

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:28.070
Shion?

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:30.250
Isn't that what being a journalist is about?

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:31.450
Mind your own business!

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:38.120
Hey! What are you doing-kuma? Show's about to start-kuma!

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:40.330
R-Right, we'll be right there-pri!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:43.170
And this will be your last show.

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:46.460
It must be seen to be believed.

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:50.880
Allow me to teach you about PriPara.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:57.600
My last show? I'll sing from the bottom of my heart so that you learn to love PriPara.

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:01.310
So please watch. This is my last request!

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:04.700
Request? You call <i>this</i> requesting?

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:05.320
Let go of me!

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:06.360
Right this way!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:08.700
Hey, come on!

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:10.740
Lala...

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:13.920
I'll do my best.

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:17.990
I'll do my best to change her mind.

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:20.520
Yeah!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.840
Scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:30.960
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:34.190
Coord Change Start!

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:41.760
The colorful Froggy Coord makes for cute pop-style transformation!

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:44.470
Froggy Rainbow!

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:52.620
And Mireille is going with the new fall edition, Froggy Natural Coord.

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:56.580
Froggy Natural! Pri!

00:16:58.480 --> 00:17:01.370
The brilliant pop style suits you perfectly.

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:04.190
And here comes the cool frog.

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:05.960
Froggy Purple!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.510
Watch carefully.

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:12.020
I get it, geez!

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:13.700
I won't run, let me go already!

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:14.460
Very well.

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:16.840
Let's just get this over with so I can go home.

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:04.680
<i>What? What is this radiance?</i>

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:07.340
SoLaMi SMILE really is the best!

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:09.000
They're really great!

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:13.100
And Lala really helped us out this one time.

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:13.860
Eh?

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:27.850
You can always tell that they're working really hard to make their fans happy.

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:29.170
That makes me want to do my best too!

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:35.120
<i>Come to think of it, they did remember the names of those fans off the top of their heads.</i>

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:37.700
<i>They must have memorized a ton.</i>

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:40.110
<i>And they worked hard on their practice as well as homework.</i>

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:46.880
<i>Maybe that effort was what made Koga focus on cheering them on so much.</i>

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:48.770
<i>What does PriPara mean to you, Lala?</i>

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:52.060
<i>It's the place where I get to shine together with everyone!</i>

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:57.090
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:15.060
Fresh Sweet Park

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:19.380
<i>Everyone's taking in SoLaMi SMILE's energy.</i>

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:22.840
<i>The fans all look just as radiant!</i>

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:27.170
Cyalume Change!

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:52.840
You're the best!

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:54.670
SoLaMi SMILE!
Lovely!

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:03.090
I have been expecting you, Tokuda.

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:06.100
And? Do you have proof? Do you have the proof?

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:07.260
Yes.

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:11.310
Oh my! I knew you could do it!

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.230
Now, show it to me, please!

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:19.640
What's all this?

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:23.440
PriPara was a wonderful place

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:26.410
where idols work together with their friends.

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:29.790
They were all very admirable, and positively glowed with energy.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.280
I used to think it was no good at all.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:34.220
But that was clearly a misjudgment.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:37.840
That is not the report I wanted to hear at all!

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:39.320
Get out of my office!

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:51.640
This is really me? So cute!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:56.150
Nene, thank you for not telling the headmistress.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.170
Very cute.

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:58.360
Like a different girl-pri!

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:00.440
You see PriPara's appeal now?

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:03.950
Yes. And I'd be much obliged if you'd trade friend tickets with me.

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:08.110
I've become a SoLaMi SMILE fan!

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:10.120
I'll make sure to show my support!

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:11.150
Yeah!

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:14.620
Thank you too, Shion.

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:17.090
I didn't really do anything.

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:17.580
But...

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:23.670
I'll be taking these.

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:30.310
She's so cool!

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:32.850
Nene, come see our shows again!

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:34.940
Capisce!

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:06.580
Next Episode Preview

00:23:06.580 --> 00:23:07.750
Happy Halloween!

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:10.150
Everyone in PriPara is going crazy over Halloween-kuma!

00:23:10.150 --> 00:23:13.870
And Lala, you're on ghost duty at the haunted house.

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:15.660
Whaat? No way, not happening!

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:19.540
I hate ghosts! No way can I scare anyone else!

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:20.870
Huh? Stop being so selfish!

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:23.290
Becoming a ghost is part of your idol training!

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:25.580
S-Scary... But capisce!

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:28.680
I found someone else to spook with me too, so I'll do my best!

00:23:28.680 --> 00:23:29.930
Next time: Halloween Terror! Jack-OH! Ran-tern!?

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:32.530
Halloween Terror!
Jack-OH! Ran-tern!?

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:35.230
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
